classes/ - class and operator examples (Python 2.7)
=================================================

These are teaching demos of user-defined classes and operators.
They predate some 2.x builtins but remain useful illustrations.

  bitvec.py     Bit-vector class
  complex.py    Complex numbers as a class (builtin complex also exists)
  dates.py      Date arithmetic (Tim Peters)
  range.py      Lazy range-like sequence
  rat.py        Rational numbers
  rev.py        Reverse view of a sequence
  vec.py        Simple vector

  class.doc     Longer notes on the Complex demo

Run:

  Python complex.py
  (most modules are importable libraries; some print a self-test)

dbm.py was removed: classic dbm is not part of this Amiga build.
Use anydbm / dumbdbm from the standard library if you need a DBM.
